  "nameEn": "Lighthouse on the Summit",
  "descriptionNightEn": "Reach the summit in 9 jumps. Before a wall try right, otherwise turn the robot left. Repair sparking lamps and light them, light the dark ones, leave the shining ones, and light the lighthouse at the end.",
  "descriptionEn": "A steep stepped path leads to a lighthouse cottage on the summit. On the way — sparking lamps and lamps that already shine.",
  "descriptionDayEn": "Reach the summit in 9 jumps. Before a wall try right, otherwise turn the robot left. Only repair sparking lamps, and turn off the ones that shine and the lighthouse."
}
